          <groundspeak:finder id="181446">DanOCan</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP 467 - Andrew [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After sitting idle for more than six years, I was a little worried about being able to find this cap given that it is listed as being 5cm BGL but while I was staring at my phone trying to bring up photos from past logs, EmOCan walked right to the divot on the ground and quickly exposed the cap with her foot.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
