          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP467 Andrew&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managed to get this one in between rain storms. Maybe if I had looked at the hint it would not have taken so long to find. TFTBC&lt;/p&gt;

